e">122</span><br><span class="line">123</span><br><span class="line">124</span><br><span class="line">125</span><br><span class="line">126</span><br><span class="line">127</span><br><span class="line">128</span><br><span class="line">129</span><br><span class="line">130</span><br><span class="line">131</span><br><span class="line">132</span><br><span class="line">133</span><br><span class="line">134</span><br><span class="line">135</span><br><span class="line">136</span><br><span class="line">137</span><br><span class="line">138</span><br><span class="line">139</span><br><span class="line">140</span><br><span class="line">141</span><br><span class="line">142</span><br><span class="line">143</span><br><span class="line">144</span><br><span class="line">145</span><br><span class="line">146</span><br><span class="line">147</span><br><span class="line">148</span><br><span class="line">149</span><br><span class="line">150</span><br><span class="line">151</span><br><span class="line">152</span><br><span class="line">153</span><br><span class="line">154</span><br><span class="line">155</span><br><span class="line">156</span><br><span class="line">157</span><br><span class="line">158</span><br><span class="line">159</span><br><span class="line">160</span><br><span class="line">161</span><br><span class="line">162</span><br><span class="line">163</span><br><span class="line">164</span><br><span class="line">165</span><br><span class="line">166</span><br><span class="line">167</span><br><span class="line">168</span><br><span class="line">169</span><br><span class="line">170</span><br><span class="line">171</span><br><span class="line">172</span><br><span class="line">173</span><br><span class="line">174</span><br><span class="line">175</span><br><span class="line">176</span><br><span class="line">177</span><br><span class="line">178</span><br><span class="line">179</span><br><span class="line">180</span><br><span class="line">181</span><br><span class="line">182</span><br><span class="line">183</span><br><span class="line">184</span><br><span class="line">185</span><br><span class="line">186</span><br><span class="line">187</span><br><span class="line">188</span><br><span class="line">189</span><br><span class="line">190</span><br><span class="line">191</span><br><span class="line">192</span><br><span class="line">193</span><br><span class="line">194</span><br><span class="line">195</span><br><span class="line">196</span><br><span class="line">197</span><br><span class="line">198</span><br><span class="line">199</span><br><span class="line">200</span><br><span class="line">201</span><br><span class="line">202</span><br><span class="line">203</span><br><span class="line">204</span><br><span class="line">205</span><br><span class="line">206</span><br><span class="line">207</span><br><span class="line">208</span><br><span class="line">209</span><br><span class="line">210</span><br><span class="line">211</span><br><span class="line">212</span><br><span class="line">213</span><br><span class="line">214</span><br><span class="line">215</span><br><span class="line">216</span><br><span class="line">217</span><br><span class="line">218</span><br><span class="line">219</span><br><span class="line">220</span><br><span class="line">221</span><br><span class="line">222</span><br><span class="line">223</span><br><span class="line">224</span><br><span class="line">225</span><br><span class="line">226</span><br><span class="line">227</span><br><span class="line">228</span><br><span class="line">229</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">// kpts_match_libtorch_v2.cpp : 此文件包含 &quot;main&quot; 函数。程序执行将在此处开始并结束。</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">/**********************************************************************************************************</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> * 【环境配置说明】</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 操作系统：windows10(cpu 16G + gpu 6G)</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- VS版本：VS2017</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- python版本：3.8.5（将.pth文件转成.pt文件）</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- torch版本：1.7.1 + cu102</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- torchaudio版本：0.7.2</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- torchvision版本：0.8.2 + cu102</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- cuda版本：10.2.89</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- cudnn版本：7.6.2.24</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- libtorch版本：1.7.1 + cu102</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- opencv版本：4.5.1</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> * 【模型说明】</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- superpoint_v2.pt: 用torch.jit.script()转换得到的模型，将数据输入该模型进行前向传播直接得到特征点、得分以及描述子</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- superglue_indoor.pt：用torch.jit.script()转换得到的模型，对应python中的superglue_indoor.pth模型。</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- superglue_outdoor.pt：用torch.jit.script()转换得到的模型，对应python中的superglue_outdoor.pth模型。</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> * 【较V2版本的改进】</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 函数封装</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 可选择模型运行的设备(my_device)：CPU(at::kCPU)/GPU(at::kCUDA)</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 可选择是否显示结果(show_result)：true/false</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 将输入由两张图像改为一个包含多张图像的文件夹，文件夹下的图像两两进行匹配</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 将superpoint检测得到的特征点坐标及描述子输出到特征点文件（.key文件）</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> *- 将superglue的匹配结果输出到匹配文件（matches.txt文件）</span><br><span class="hljs-comment"> **********************************************************************************************************/</span><br><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;torch/torch.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;torch/script.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;memory&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;opencv2/opencv.hpp&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;opencv2/core.hpp&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;opencv2/imgcodecs.hpp&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;opencv2/highgui.hpp&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&quot;Processing.h&quot;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;time.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> cv;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> torch;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> torch::indexing;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">//可修改参数</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">/************************************************************************************************************/</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span>* superpoint_module_path = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;../exp_data/superpoint_v2.pt&quot;</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//superpoint模型文件</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span>* superglue_indoor_module_path = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;../exp_data/superglue_indoor.pt&quot;</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//superglue_indoor模型文件</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span>* superglue_outdoor_module_path = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;../exp_data/superglue_outdoor.pt&quot;</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//superglue_outfoor模型文件</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">bool</span> indoor_model = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//true则加载superglue_indoor模型文件，false则加载superglue_outdoor模型文件</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> Size re_size = <span class="hljs-built_in">Size</span>(<span class="hljs-number">640</span>, <span class="hljs-number">480</span>);<span class="hljs-comment">//输入网络的图像尺寸（对原图像缩放后的尺寸）</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">int</span> max_keypoints = <span class="hljs-number">1200</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//特征点的最大数量，-1默认全部保留</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> my_device = at::kCUDA;<span class="hljs-comment">//at::kCUDA：在GPU上运行模型；at::kCPU：在CPU上运行模型</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">bool</span> show_result = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;<span class="hljs-comment">//true：显示结果，false：不显示结果</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">/************************************************************************************************************/</span><br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> argc, <span class="hljs-type">char</span>* argv[])</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br><span class="hljs-comment">//1.检查输入参数</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (argc != <span class="hljs-number">3</span>)<br>&#123;<br>cerr &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[Error] usage: example-app &lt;input dir&gt; &lt;output dir&gt;&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> EXIT_FAILURE;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">//2.打印模型运行设备</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (my_device == at::kCUDA)<br>&#123;<br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[Info] Running the module on GPU!&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">else</span><br>&#123;<br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[Info] Running the module on CPU!&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">//3.加载superpoint模型</span><br><span class="hljs-type">clock_t</span> superpoint_load_start, superpoint_load_finish;<br>torch::jit::script::Module superpoint_module;<br>superpoint_load_start = <span class="hljs-built_in">clock</span>();<span class="hljs-comment">//开始计时</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> &#123;<br><span class="hljs-comment">//反序列化：导入TorchScript模型</span><br>superpoint_module = torch::jit::<span class="hljs-built_in">load</span>(superpoint_module_path);<br>&#125;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (<span class="hljs-type">const</span> c10::Error&amp; e) &#123;<br>cerr &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[Error] error loading the module: &quot;</span> &lt;&lt; superpoint_module_path &lt;&lt; endl;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> EXIT_FAILURE;<br>&#125;<br>superpoint_load_finish = <span class="hljs-built_in">clock</span>();<span class="hljs-comment">//结束计时</span><br>superpoint_module.<span class="hljs-built_in">to</span>(my_device);<span class="hljs-comment">//将模型放在指定设备上</span><br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[Info] Successfully loaded the module: &quot;</span> &lt;&lt; superpoint_module_path &lt;&lt; endl;<br>cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;[Time_info] Time spent loading superpoint module: &quot;</span> &lt;&lt; (<span class="hljs-type">double</span>)(superpoint_load_finish - superpoint_load_start) / CLOCKS_PER_SEC &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;s&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">//4.加载superglue模型</span><br><span class="hljs-type">const<